[0.014, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G3.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mJ61, landing under a low cover from any side:\u001b[52G\u001b[22myou\u001b[56Gsaid\u001b[61Gyou'd\u001b[67Gfind\u001b[72Gthe\u001b[76Gcause\u001b[82Gby\u001b[85Gflying\u001b[92Gthe\u001b[96Gapproaches\u001b[107Gin\u001b[110Gthe\u001b[114GGUI.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6GIt's done when you have, and no Manifest task\u001b[52Ghits it yet.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mNot scheduled yet:\u001b[22G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[26Gdense\u001b[32Ggeometry\u001b[41Gand\u001b[45Gray\u001b[49Gtracing\u001b[57Gtrack\u001b[63G(J36–J50)\u001b[73Gand\u001b[77Gthe\u001b[81Gcharacters\u001b[92Gtrack\u001b[98G(J51–J60).\u001b[109GBoth\u001b[114Gare\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bplanned, and neither start\u001b[30G until you\u001b[41Gplace it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mMy recommendation:\u001b[22G\u001b[22mdo\u001b[25GJ30\u001b[29Gnext.\u001b[35GIt\u001b[38Ghas\u001b[42Ga\u001b[44Gconcrete\u001b[53GManifest\u001b[62Gconsumer,\u001b[72Gand\u001b[76Git's\u001b[81Gcheaper\u001b[89Gbefore\u001b[96GL15\u001b[100Gbuilds\u001b[107Gits\u001b[111Gown\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bworkaround. J07's rows have no one\u001b[38Gasking for th\u001b[52Gm yet. Say the wo\u001b[70Gd\u001b[76GI'll\u001b[81Gplan it\u001b[89Gin a free lane.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI\u001b[5Gdidn't\u001b[12Gcheck\u001b[18GManifest's\u001b[29G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdelivery-order.md\u001b[47G\u001b[39mto\u001b[50Gconfirm\u001b[58Gwhere\u001b[64GL15\u001b[68Gsits\u001b[73Gin\u001b[76Gits\u001b[80Gqueue.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCooked for 9s · done 11:05 am\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mNo point playing a look until the GUI is ready. The TUI is mainly for admin, but should also be capable of a gameplay\u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255ml\u001b[5Go\u001