[0.003, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BWhat\u001b[8Gthis\u001b[13Gmeans\u001b[19Gacross\u001b[26Gboth\u001b[31Grepos:\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mJettison:\u001b[22m J30 (the shell \u001b[31Gtarted through a \u001b[49Gessi\u001b[54Gn) is the only engine work L15 needs.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mManifest, the GUI:\u001b[22m L15 also needs L04 and L05 (station\u001b[60Gpolicy and ownership\u001b[81Gviews)\u001b[88Gand\u001b[92GL29\u001b[96G(tax\u001b[101Gsettings).\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mManifest, the TUI:\u001b[24G\u001b[22mfor\u001b[28Gthe\u001b[32GTUI\u001b[36Gto\u001b[39Gplay\u001b[44Ga\u001b[46Gfull\u001b[51Gloop\u001b[56Git\u001b[59Gneeds\u001b[65GL44,\u001b[70Gwhich\u001b[76Gadds\u001b[81Gthe\u001b[85Gconsole's\u001b[95Gmissing\u001b[103Gcommands\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  (policies, founding,\u001b[26Gfees\u001b[31Gand refuelling,\u001b[47Gtenders)\u001b[56Gand\u001b[60Gmakes\u001b[66G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mobserve\u001b[74G\u001b[39mshow\u001b[79Gthe\u001b[83Gwhole\u001b[89Gsnapshot.\u001b[99GL41's\u001b[105Gresending\u001b[115Gof\u001b[118Ga\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Blost\u001b[10Grequest\u001b[18Galso\u001b[23Gmatters\u001b[31Gfor\u001b[35Greal\u001b[40Gplay.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mManifest's docs are still out of date:\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249msession-handoff.md:20\u001b[39m still says later work waits\u001b[94Guntil\u001b[100Gyou've\u001b[107Gplayed\u001b[114Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gloop. \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mconsole.md\u001b[39m doesn't \u001b[31Gay the TUI is for administrati\u001b[62Gn but should still\u001b[81Gbe able to\u001b[92Gplay a loop.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BShould I fix\u001b[16Gthose two\u001b[26GManifest\u001b[35Gdocs and plan J30 in\u001b[57G free lane?\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI\u001b[5Ghaven't committed anything or checked where L44 sits against\u001b[66GL15 in Manifest's queue.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCogitated for 32s · done 11:06 am\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mFix the docs, commit, no gate, then start J30, and advise if something can run in parallel with it in another lane.\u001b[39m   \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m·\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;235;159;127mFla\u001b[38;2;215;119;87mmbéing… \r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  Tip: Run claude --continue or claude --resume to resume a session\r\u001b[3B❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[38C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
