[0.262, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G-\u001b[5GThe ground sample's rover becomes part\u001b[44Gof the world's starting state instead of being made when\u001b[101Gthe first scene\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bloads.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mrender_test\u001b[17G\u001b[39mgets\u001b[22Ga\u001b[24Gsmall\u001b[30Gbuilt-in\u001b[39Gworld.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- Neither should change any\u001b[31Greference\u001b[41Gframe\u001b[47Gor\u001b[50Gstate\u001b[56Ghash.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mCosts and limits:\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[22mThe content\u001b[17Gis mounted twice: a read-only\u001b[47Gcopy\u001b[52Gfor\u001b[56Gthe\u001b[60Gworld,\u001b[67Gand\u001b[71Gthe\u001b[75Gshell's\u001b[83Gcopy\u001b[88Gwith\u001b[93Gthe\u001b[97Gwritable\u001b[106Guser\u001b[111Gdirectory\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gon \u001b[9Gop for saves. That is\u001b[31Ga small sta\u001b[43Gt-up co\u001b[52G.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GMods'\u001b[11Gscripts\u001b[19Gstill\u001b[25Grun\u001b[29Gonly\u001b[34Gin\u001b[37Gthe\u001b[41Gclient,\u001b[49Gso\u001b[52Ga\u001b[54Gdedicated\u001b[64Gserver\u001b[71Gstill\u001b[77Gdoesn't\u001b[85Grun\u001b[89Gthem.\u001b[95GThat's\u001b[102Ga\u001b[104Ggap\u001b[108GJ30\u001b[112Gleaves\u001b[119Gas\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  it is, and I'll\u001b[21Gnote\u001b[26Git\u001b[29Gin\u001b[32Gthe\u001b[36Gdocs.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BConnecting the\u001b[20Ggraphical client\u001b[37Gto a remote serve\u001b[56Gstays Manifest's L15 work.\u001b[83G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat doesn't change:\u001b[22m the frame\u001b[34Gloop, the save\u001b[49Gf\u001b[51Grmat, the con\u001b[65Gole, and the step rate and seed (1/60 s, seed 0).\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BNow star\u001b[20Gimplementation in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mjettison.lane-c\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✽\u001b[3GIonizing\u001b[38;2;235;159;127m…\u001b[38;2;