\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat it means for a game author:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- A game is two classes with separate\u001b[41Gjobs:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G-\u001b[7G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mHost::Game\u001b[39m ho\u001b[21Gd\u001b[23G the rule\u001b[33G and \u001b[39Ghe world:\u001b[49Gits\u001b[53Gtypes,\u001b[60Gits\u001b[64Gcontent,\u001b[73Gits\u001b[77Gworld\u001b[83Gand\u001b[87Gits\u001b[91Gstarting\u001b[100Gstate.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mApp:\u001b[12GGame\u001b[39m holds the look and feel:\u001b[42Ginput,\u001b[49Gscenes, UI, sounds, pick\u001b[74Gng\u001b[77Gand saves.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GThe shell's\u001b[17Gown copi\u001b[26Gs \u001b[29Gf world start-u\u001b[45G (\u001b[75G world handle\u001b[89Gin\u001b[92G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mRegister\u001b[39m)\u001b[102Gare\u001b[106Gremoved.\u001b[27;1H\u001b[21;3H\u001b[?25h"]
