by your\u001b[89Grule\u001b[94Gthey belong on\u001b[109Gthe server,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bnot the\u001b[11Gclien\u001b[17G. J30 leaves them in the shell, where they w\u001b[62Gre, and the\u001b[74Gdocs recor\u001b[86Git as a limit.\u001b[101GI'd add moving\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bscripts\u001b[11Ginto\u001b[16Gthe\u001b[20Gsession\u001b[28Gas\u001b[31Ga\u001b[33Gbacklog\u001b[41Gitem\u001b[46Grather\u001b[53Gthan\u001b[58Gwiden\u001b[64GJ30.\u001b[69GTell\u001b[74Gme\u001b[77Gif\u001b[80Gyou'd\u001b[86Grather\u001b[93Git\u001b[96Gwent\u001b[101Ginto\u001b[106GJ30.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BCarrying\u001b[12Gon:\u001b[16Groadmap\u001b[24Gand\u001b[28Ghistory,\u001b[37Gformatting,\u001b[49Gtidy,\u001b[55Gthen\u001b[60Gthe\u001b[64Ggate.\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G                     \u001b[25G             \u001b[27;1H\u001b[21;3H\u001b[?25h"]
