[0.015, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BCa\u001b[6Grying on:\u001b[16Groadmap and\u001b[28Ghistory, f\u001b[39Grma\u001b[43Gting, tidy, then the\u001b[64Ggate.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern, listed \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m directory, ran \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(~/projects/jettison.lane-c/docs/history/neutral-sdk.md)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded\u001b[12G\u001b[1m7\u001b[14G\u001b[22mlines\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 268 \u001b[22m | --- | --- | --- |\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 269 \u001b[12G\u001b[22m|\u001b[14GJ05. Packs\u001b[25Gand\u001b[29Gmods\u001b[34G|\u001b[36GNone\u001b[41Gyet;\u001b[46GManifest's\u001b[57Gmods\u001b[62Gare\u001b[66Gthe\u001b[70Gfirst\u001b[76Gconsumer\u001b[85G|\u001b[87GA\u001b[89Gpatch\u001b[95Gcould\u001b[101Gonly\u001b[106Greplace\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m   \u001b[12G\u001b[22ma\u001b[14Glist,\u001b[20Ga pack was read\u001b[36Gas\u001b[39Git\u001b[42Gwas\u001b[46Gmounted,\u001b[55Gand\u001b[59Gonly\u001b[64Gdefinitions\u001b[76Gand\u001b[80Gstring\u001b[87Gtables\u001b[94Glayered,\u001b[103Gso\u001b[106Ga\u001b[108Gmod\u001b[112Gre\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m   \u001b[12G\u001b[22mplaced\u001b[19Ga scene or a \u001b[33Gtylesh\u001b[40Get whole. **Done** 2026-11-26: a \u001b[74Geque\u001b[79Gce tagged\u001b[89G`!remove` (sca\u001b[104Gars) or `!\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bremove=<field>` (recor\u001b[35Gs) takes eleme\u001b[51Gs out of the\u001b[64Gone below, refused with the layer an\u001b[101G the\u001b[106Gvalue\u001b[112Gwh\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Ben one\u001b[19Gis not there; `FileSys\u001b[42Gem::R\u001b[48Gfresh` opens a pack again when its tim\u001b[87G,\u001b[89Gsiz\u001b[93G \u001b[95Gr inode changed,\u001b[112Gca\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Blled by th\u001b[23G resou\u001b[30Gce manager befor\u001b[47G \u001b[49Gach\