\u001b[15Gwith a\u001b[22Gwarning, tried again on the next\u001b[55Gcha\u001b[59Gge;\u001b[63G`FileSystem::ReadPatched`\u001b[89Gholds the layering rules\u001b[K\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bth\u001b[15G definition registry had,\u001b[41Gshared\u001b[48Gnow by `Sc\u001b[59Gne::Load(files, path)` and `SceneFile::R\u001b[100Gad(files, path\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1B)`, which\u001b[22Gthe shell's scene uses,\u001b[46Gand\u001b[50Gby \u001b[54Ghe UI's file interface, which appends a `<name>.patch.\u001b[109Gcss`\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bafter the stylesheet below it. Th\u001b[46G e\u001b[49Ggine reads no YAML star or s\u001b[78Gatic \"system\" of its own, so none wa\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bs layered; a gam\u001b[29G's are its\u001b[40Gcontent. A pa\u001b[54Gch\u001b[57Gwith\u001b[62Gno whole file under it now says\u001b[94G\"patches \u001b[104G file that\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1B no mount\u001b[22Ghas a whole file\u001b[39Gfor\". No\u001b[76G\u001b[38;2;230;219;116ms and mods\u001b[39m](../files-and-mod\u001b[105G.md)).\u001b[112G|\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[21;3H\u001b[?25h"]
