[0.264, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(~/projects/jettison.lane-c/docs/history/neutral-sdk.md)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded \u001b[1m7\u001b[22m lines\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 268 \u001b[12G\u001b[22m|\u001b[14G--- |\u001b[20G---\u001b[24G|\u001b[26G---\u001b[30G|\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m9\u001b[14G\u001b[22mJ05. Packs and mods\u001b[34G|\u001b[36GNone\u001b[41Gyet;\u001b[46GManifest's\u001b[57Gmods\u001b[62Gare\u001b[66Gthe\u001b[70Gfirst\u001b[76Gconsumer\u001b[85G|\u001b[87GA\u001b[89Gpatch\u001b[95Gcould\u001b[101Gonly\u001b[106Greplace\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m   \u001b[12G\u001b[22ma\u001b[14Glist, \u001b[21G pack was read\u001b[36Gas it was\u001b[46Gmount\u001b[52Gd, and only definit\u001b[72Gons\u001b[76Gand string\u001b[87Gtables layered, so\u001b[106Ga mod re\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bplaced a scene\u001b[27Gor a style\u001b[38Gheet whole. **Done**\u001b[59G2026-11-26: a sequence tag\u001b[86Ged `!remove` (scalars) \u001b[110Gr\u001b[112G`!\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bremove=<field>` (records) takes elements \u001b[54Gut of the one below, refus\u001b[81Gd with the layer and the value\u001b[112Gwh\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Ben \u001b[16Gn\u001b[18G is not the\u001b[31G; `FileSystem::Refre\u001b[52Gh` opens a pack\u001b[68Gagain wh\u001b[77Gn its\u001b[83Gt\u001b[85Gme, size or ino\u001b[101Ge changed,\u001b[112Gca\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Blled by the resou\u001b[30Gce\u001b[33Gmanager b\u001b[43Gfore each hot-relo\u001b[62Gd check, a pack that\u001b[83Gdoes not open\u001b[97Gkeeping the old o\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bne with\u001b[20Ga wa\u001b[25Gning, tried again on th\u001b[49G next change; `FileSystem::ReadPatch\u001b[86Gd` holds the layering ru\u001b[111Ges\u001b[K\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bthe definitio\u001b[26G registry h\u001b[38Gd, shared now by\u001b[55G`Scen\u001b[61G::Load(files, path)` and `SceneFile::Re\u001b[101Gd(f\u001b[105Gles, path\r