[0.089, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m Collision shapes will be baked by the cook into a world-content file that both client and server read, and J12 will\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  bake the same file through a small tool until the cook exists. I'm holding off on editing lane C while its gate runs,\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  and the approved split goes onto the roadmap once it passes.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mWhat was something quick and unrelated we can do in a spare lane?\u001b[39m                                                     \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m patterns \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mTwo small candidates f\u001b[26Gr jettison.lane-b, J17\u001b[49G(r\u001b[52Gnaming two constants to clearer names, about ten m\u001b[103Gnutes)\u001b[110Gand J34\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B(\u001b[5Gaming\u001b[12G lock's\u001b[20Gho\u001b[23Gder in its file,\u001b[40Gabout an hour),\u001b[56Gwith J17 as my pick;\u001b[77Gsay\u001b[81Ggo\u001b[84Gand\u001b[88GI'll\u001b[93Gstart\u001b[99Git.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\r\u001b[2B●\u001b[39m Running cd '/home/ivan/projects/jettison.lane-c/' && ./sc…\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ cd '/home/ivan/projects/jettison.lane-c/' && ./scripts/ci.sh --werror --asan --log build/gate.log (9m 5s · 2 \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mlines)\u001b[13G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;233;154;122mIonizing…\u001b[67G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mthought for 8s)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[21;3H\u001b[?25h"]
