[0.077, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m I'm merging the per-branch checks into one stack with a single gate, fast-forwarding L44 into Manifest's feature-base\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  since it already passed its own gate. I'm also checking how far J30's running gate has progressed before deciding\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bwhether\u001b[11Gto\u001b[14Gstop\u001b[19Git.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mMerged \u001b[1ml44-console-commands\u001b[22m, read \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mMa\u001b[6Gifes\u001b[11G's f\u001b[17Gture-base\u001b[27Gsits at\u001b[35Gb503fb9 with L44, and I'm stopping J30's gate\u001b[81Gat clang-tidy since\u001b[101Gthe combine\u001b[113G gate\r\u001b[3C\u001b[1Bill cover\u001b[14Gi\u001b[16G anyway.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\r\u001b[67C\u001b[6Bthought for 3s)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[20;3H\u001b[?25h"]
