[0.026, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe gate\u001b[22m passed in 228 s, and\u001b[35G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfeature-base\u001b[39m is pushed\u001b[58Gt\u001b[61G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m21c70c6\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mcross-review\u001b[22m covers \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmain..\u001b[48G\u001b[39m(the w\u001b[55Gole stack since\u001b[71GJ02–J09)\u001b[80Gand\u001b[84Gruns\u001b[89Gin\u001b[92G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mjettison.lane-b\u001b[108G\u001b[39mon\u001b[111Gbranch\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mstage-j30\u001b[39m. It takes about ten minutes, with no edits in that lan\u001b[71Gwhile it\u001b[80Gruns. The brief sets out 12\u001b[108Gclaims for\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BCodex to attack: J30's single\u001b[35Gsourc\u001b[41G of truth for \u001b[56Ghe world,\u001b[66Gits lifetimes\u001b[80Gand mounts, the\u001b[96Glocale rule\u001b[108Gfor test\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bruns,\u001b[11GJ34, J32 and the\u001b[28Gpartial\u001b[36G.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI'll\u001b[8Ganswer\u001b[15Geach\u001b[20Gfinding\u001b[28Gwith\u001b[33Ga\u001b[35Gfix\u001b[39Gor\u001b[42Gevidence,\u001b[52Gfor\u001b[56Gup\u001b[59Gto\u001b[62Gthree\u001b[68Grounds,\u001b[76Gand\u001b[80Gbring\u001b[86Gyou\u001b[90Gwhatever\u001b[99Gis\u001b[102Gleft\u001b[107Gopen.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GChurned for 6m 30s · done 12:05 pm\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m※\u001b[3G\u001b[1mrecap: \u001b[22m\u001b[3mJ30, the shell starting its world through a session for Manifest's graphical client, plus several small items, \r\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m\u001b[3mis gated and pushed. Cross-review round 1 is running in lane B, \u001b[69Gd next I'll answer its findings. (turn\u001b[108Goff recaps in\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B/config)\u001b[23m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;107;128m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mBackground\u001b[14Gcommand\u001b[22G\"Run\u001b[27Gthe\u001b[31Gcross-review\u001b[44Ground\u001b[50G1\u001b[52Gof\u001b[55Gmain..feature-base\"\u001b[75Gfailed\u001b[82Gwith\u001b[87Gexit\u001b[92Gcode\u001b[97G1\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, listed \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m directory \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m Round 1 asks for changes: seven findings, and all are real. Reading\u001b[71Gthe\u001b[75Greviewer's\u001b[86Gprobes\u001b[93Gbefore\u001b[100Gfixing.\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✽\u001b[3GCogitating… \u001b[38G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mthought for 41s)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
