[0.204, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m※\u001b[3G\u001b[1mrecap: \u001b[22m\u001b[3mJ30, the shell starting its world through a session for Manifest's graphical client, plus several small items, \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bis gated and pushed. Cross-review round 1 is running in lane B, and next I'll answer its findings. (turn off recaps in\r\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m\u001b[3m/config)\u001b[23m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;107;128m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mBackground\u001b[14Gcommand\u001b[22G\"Run\u001b[27Gthe\u001b[31Gcross-review\u001b[44Ground\u001b[50G1\u001b[52Gof\u001b[55Gmain..feature-base\"\u001b[75Gfailed\u001b[82Gwith\u001b[87Gexit\u001b[92Gcode\u001b[97G1\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, listed \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m directory \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRound 1 asks for changes: seven findings,\u001b[45Gand\u001b[49Gall\u001b[53Gare\u001b[57Greal.\u001b[63GReading\u001b[71Gthe\u001b[75Greviewer's\u001b[86Gprobes\u001b[93Gbefore\u001b[100Gfixing.\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m5\u001b[22m patterns, read \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, listed \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m directory, ran \u001b[1m5\u001b[22m shell commands · \u001b[38;2;255;107;128m1 failed\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI'm fixing all seven findings: F1 excludes mods named after the shell's mounts, F2 adds a random\u001b[100Gtoken\u001b[106Gto\u001b[109Gpartial\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bnames\u001b[9Gand\u001b[13Gstops\u001b[19Gfailed\u001b[26Gwrites\u001b[33Gfrom\u001b[38Gdeleting\u001b[47Gfiles\u001b[53Gthey\u001b[58Gdidn't\u001b[65Gcreate,\u001b[73GF3\u001b[76Gsweeps\u001b[83Gabandoned\u001b[93Gpartials\u001b[102Gonce\u001b[107Gper\u001b[111Gdirectory\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gper\u001b[7Gprocess, F4 and F5 get integration t\u001b[45Gts