[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mF8 (blocker):\u001b[19G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[23Gcrash\u001b[29Gcleanup\u001b[37Gcould\u001b[43Gdelete\u001b[50Gunrelated\u001b[60Gfiles\u001b[66Gending\u001b[73Gin\u001b[76G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m:partial\u001b[39m,\u001b[86Gand\u001b[90Geven\u001b[95Gan\u001b[98Gexisting\u001b[107Gtarget.\u001b[115GIt\u001b[118Gnow\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  deletes only names in exactly its\u001b[39Gown form,\u001b[50Grom pr\u001b[57Gcess\u001b[62Gs\u001b[64Gthat have\u001b[74Gended, and \u001b[86Gever the file\u001b[100Gbeing\u001b[106Gwritten.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m9\u001b[23G\u001b[22mlonger partial name\u001b[43Gbroke filenames near th\u001b[67G 255-byte limit. A\u001b[86Gpartial now\u001b[98Ghas a short name\u001b[115Gof\u001b[118Gits\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bown in the same directory, and a test\u001b[43Gwrites a 255-byte name wit\u001b[70G both write functions.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m10 (blocker):\u001b[22m a settings file with \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mui:\u001b[39m set\u001b[49Gto a plain v\u001b[62Glue made start-up fail when the\u001b[94Glangu\u001b[100Gge was saved. It now\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bjust logs th\u001b[18Gt the language couldn't be kept, and carries on\u001b[66Gin the c\u001b[75Gosen language.\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m1\u001b[10Gminor):\u001b[22m three s\u001b[26Gale code examples or comments \u001b[57Gfter J30\u001b[66Gare corrected.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BIf round 3 asks for more chang\u001b[34Gs, I'l\u001b[41G fix the\u001b[50G a\u001b[53Gd g\u001b[57Gte again. With no rounds\u001b[82Gleft\u001b[87Gafter\u001b[93Git,\u001b[97Ganything\u001b[106Gstill\u001b[112Gopen\u001b[117Gis\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Byours\u001b[9Gto\u001b[12Gsettle.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GSautéed for 11m 55s · done 12:39 pm\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mpush both\u001b[39m                                  